==Icelandic==
===Etymology===
Compare Danish ''[[mælk]]'', Dutch ''[[melk]]'', West Frisian ''[[molke]]'', German ''[[Milch]]'', Norwegian ''[[melk]]'', Old English ''[[meolc]]'', Swedish ''[[mjölk]]''.

===Noun===
'''mjólk''' {{f}} ([[mjólkur|mjólk-ur]], '''--''')

# [[milk]]
# any liquid resembling [[milk]], as the liquid within a coconut (e.g. [[kókosmjólk]]), the juice or sap of certain plants (''e.g.'' [[fíflamjólk]]), or various pharmaceutical preparations
# {{rare|lang=is}} [[milt]] from a [[fish]]


